Welcome to the MagnetDB duckdb demonstrator development environment (LNCMI)!

Base image: debian:trixie + MagnetTools from magnettools-db:trixie-1.2.6

Available tools:
  - Python with scientific computing libraries
  - Jupyter notebooks (Voila on port 8866)

Workspace: /workspaces/magnetdb-duckdb-demo
Datasets:  /mnt/LNCMIG-Data/records
DuckDB:    /data/duckdb
Projects:  /home/myuser/hifimagnet-projects
CSV data:  /workspaces/magnetdb-duckdb-demo/Data  (repo Data/, not in git)
           SUPERVISION: Data/bdd.csv

!!! Do not forget to start the python virtualenv !!!:
source /home/myuser/.venvs/magnetdb/bin/activate
(Debian python3 + magnettools wheel, isolated venv: no system site-packages)

The workspace .venv belongs to the host: do not use it here.
Optional: .devcontainer/setup-uv.sh --system-site-packages creates
/home/myuser/.venvs/magnetdb-systempackage
(Debian python3 + python3-magnettools, uses system site-packages).
